        "sha": "83156487bc83d775b59683897a7335d2f436cb21",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/neverhuman/bullet-kernel/git/trees/83156487bc83d775b59683897a7335d2f436cb21"
      },
      "message": "Make `bullet demo` work without a working directory or an env var.\n\nRunning `bullet demo` from a directory with no `target/` failed with\n\"SQLite path contains an empty or non-normal component\", which reads as a\ncorrupt install rather than a missing variable. Two causes.\n\nThe default data directory was the relative `./target/demo`, so where it\nresolved depended on where you stood. Default to an absolute private path\nunder the user's state directory instead; BULLET_DATA_DIR still wins.\n\nAnd `demo` created that directory with `create_dir_all`, which applies the\numask, so a default 002 left it group-writable and the ledger correctly\nrefused it for custody. Create it the same private way `farm init` already\ndoes.\n\n`bullet demo` now runs from anywhere with no environment set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
